  "referenceNumber": "GHR0136",
  "remarks": "\nTIRZAH VALLEY FARM OUTPOST, including persons residing in the outpost (hereafter “TIRZAH VALLEY FARM”) is an involved person within the meaning of the Global Human Rights Sanctions Regulations 2020 on the basis of the following ground: TIRZAH VALLEY FARM is associated with a person who is or has been involved in activity which amounts to facilitating, inciting, promoting or providing support for  activity which amounts to a serious abuse of the right of individuals not to be subjected to cruel, inhuman or degrading treatment or punishment.\n",
